mixin question(q)
  div.card.my-3
    div.card-header: strong #[i.fa-solid.fa-message] #{q}
    div.card-body
      block

.row
  .col-lg.mb-3
    :markdown-it
      ## About me

      If you don't know me, hi! I'm DarkblooM.  
      I'm a 23 year old computer science student from France.
      
      My pronouns are... uh... all of them. I really don't care.
      
      My main points of interest are:

      - computer science
      - gaming
      - music
      - motorcycles
    div
      img.img-fluid.rounded.shadow.w-auto(src="https://files.catbox.moe/6yrqpu.png" alt="DarkblooM profile picture")
